{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Godforged: Origins of Ozgalor",
    "steam_appid": 2996620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d1c3c1c98ca01ea3f7f11339fde3b59e.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=134 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Godforged: Origins of Ozgalor</strong> is a single-player action RPG where tactical combat meets branching narrative. Set in the mythic world of Nelethar, you\u2019ll shape your legacy in a land torn by betrayal, ancient powers, and the fading light of unity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young noble thrust into leadership as Ozgalor crumbles under the shadow of the Forgotten One. Your journey will test your will, challenge your beliefs, and force you to choose between unity and unchecked power.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/bfbeb097b9fc47a79ceab1559f95e050.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ozgalor is an archipelago shaped by myth and conflict, inspired by Balkan folklore and brought to life through stylized, hand-crafted visuals. Each region holds echoes of ancient traditions, lost histories, and long-buried secrets waiting to be unearthed.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/924219ad6a6d4dbbbd3d25dcacb205bb.avif?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/293add5d93f15a56cf26a615e63b9804.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e4eec15c031778d06bf7abe77390e99d.avif?t=1754393727\" width=282 height=11 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ozgalor is a fractured archipelago shaped by storms, ruins, and forgotten magic. From deep forests to crumbling temples and wave-beaten cliffs, each region offers its own atmosphere, history, and dangers, inviting you to uncover the world\u2019s secrets, one zone at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e60ba688c839230d452ee37880ee995b.poster.avif?t=1754393727\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e60ba688c839230d452ee37880ee995b.webm?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e60ba688c839230d452ee37880ee995b.mp4?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/3e93eb337c3f1fb9c5c2f16beab2a918.avif?t=1754393727\" width=406 height=11 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield ancient rune magic in real-time, top-down combat as the Runeblade, a versatile warrior-mage hybrid designed for tactical play. Master the core archetype or specialize into distinct paths like the resilient Runeguard or the mystical Runemaster, each unlocking unique rune slots, abilities, and combat mechanics. You can freely blend these paths to craft a playstyle that evolves with your choices and adapts to every challenge. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/00535f241a4da5add7576f7e6fb37770.poster.avif?t=1754393727\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/00535f241a4da5add7576f7e6fb37770.webm?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/00535f241a4da5add7576f7e6fb37770.mp4?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/c944e2997a1f66422b18318dc25b27cb.avif?t=1754393727\" width=244 height=11 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the power of Masselite, an unstable material infused with the essence of a fallen god. As it spreads across zones, creatures, and gear, it warps the world and tempts you with dangerous power. Cleanse corrupted zones to unlock new quests, allies, and safe routes, or absorb the corruption to gain powerful Masselite abilities at the cost of your humanity. Your decisions shift the global corruption level, reshaping environments, triggering unique events, and altering how factions react to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/8565c1b5dc19291ef0f2b1f7e473a0b8.poster.avif?t=1754393727\" width=628 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/8565c1b5dc19291ef0f2b1f7e473a0b8.webm?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/8565c1b5dc19291ef0f2b1f7e473a0b8.mp4?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e1f0302f57eb49cf294a47950bb3f690.avif?t=1754393727\" width=308 height=12 /></span><br>Godforged delivers cinematic storytelling with systemic depth. Dialogue reacts to your character's traits, choices, and corruption level, unlocking unique lines and changing how factions respond. Quests include optional goals, time-sensitive outcomes, and world-state consequences. Missed opportunities don\u2019t just vanish; they shift how the story plays out. All combined with a dynamic camera system which frames key moments with emotion and scale, bringing new life to isometric storytelling.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/cc2f7901bfd78e19b6361534912ede88.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/ddff14c1b5f3b80b734aca57c0663edc.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=134 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/a0a69ec436facbe426033238386c16e6.avif?t=1754393727\" width=205 height=14 /></span><br>Face powerful foes with distinct abilities, patterns, and phases. These encounters test your reflexes, timing, and mastery of your build. Some bosses warp the battlefield, unleash corruption-fueled attacks, or evolve mid-fight, turning each battle into a memorable trial of skill and adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d32c6db027bc1180ec709c34533a23d4.avif?t=1754393727\" data-has-big width=1600 height=904 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e79ae52ef4a737904d370ecdfd7b7441.avif?t=1754393727\" width=252 height=11 /></span><br>Recruit characters with distinct goals, perspectives, and loyalties. Some may question your decisions, others might see opportunity where others see danger. As your choices unfold\u2014especially around Masselite\u2014these relationships will shift, shaping who fights beside you, who pulls away, and who believes your path is worth following.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/cd7489c653d74109a23e7591e7098ee0.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=326 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/b29bce1a828fb9e8717cf9772c784938.avif?t=1754393727\" width=160 height=11 /></span><br>Reclaim and rebuild Castle Ebonguard as the Duke of Ebonvale. Shape your realm by choosing which buildings to restore, forging alliances with factions, and managing your reputation. Your political and strategic decisions will influence available quests, trade, and support in world events, making your stronghold a reflection of your rule across the Ozgalor Archipelago.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d89830358791bdf46eecf8910e50b5c6.avif?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=396 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d8aa22f8926a91a618d8d9fc63022326.avif?t=1754393727\" width=162 height=12 /></span><br>Time-limited events appear based on your location, choices, and the current world state. They may trigger through exploration, quests, or as corruption spreads. Events can expire, change, or be interrupted by main story progress. Completing or ignoring them affects the world, unlocking unique rewards, merchants, or new questlines. Many are tied to the Masselite system, making each decision matter beyond the moment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/9498812810d079944a12970e771bd909.avif?t=1754393727\" width=604 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p>",
