o/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/8565c1b5dc19291ef0f2b1f7e473a0b8.mp4?t=1754393727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e1f0302f57eb49cf294a47950bb3f690.avif?t=1754393727\" width=308 height=12 /></span><br>Godforged delivers cinematic storytelling with systemic depth. Dialogue reacts to your character's traits, choices, and corruption level, unlocking unique lines and changing how factions respond. Quests include optional goals, time-sensitive outcomes, and world-state consequences. Missed opportunities don\u2019t just vanish; they shift how the story plays out. All combined with a dynamic camera system which frames key moments with emotion and scale, bringing new life to isometric storytelling.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/cc2f7901bfd78e19b6361534912ede88.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/ddff14c1b5f3b80b734aca57c0663edc.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=134 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/a0a69ec436facbe426033238386c16e6.avif?t=1754393727\" width=205 height=14 /></span><br>Face powerful foes with distinct abilities, patterns, and phases. These encounters test your reflexes, timing, and mastery of your build. Some bosses warp the battlefield, unleash corruption-fueled attacks, or evolve mid-fight, turning each battle into a memorable trial of skill and adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d32c6db027bc1180ec709c34533a23d4.avif?t=1754393727\" data-has-big width=1600 height=904 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/e79ae52ef4a737904d370ecdfd7b7441.avif?t=1754393727\" width=252 height=11 /></span><br>Recruit characters with distinct goals, perspectives, and loyalties. Some may question your decisions, others might see opportunity where others see danger. As your choices unfold\u2014especially around Masselite\u2014these relationships will shift, shaping who fights beside you, who pulls away, and who believes your path is worth following.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/cd7489c653d74109a23e7591e7098ee0.avif?t=1754393727\" width=1210 height=326 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/b29bce1a828fb9e8717cf9772c784938.avif?t=1754393727\" width=160 height=11 /></span><br>Reclaim and rebuild Castle Ebonguard as the Duke of Ebonvale. Shape your realm by choosing which buildings to restore, forging alliances with factions, and managing your reputation. Your political and strategic decisions will influence available quests, trade, and support in world events, making your stronghold a reflection of your rule across the Ozgalor Archipelago.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d89830358791bdf46eecf8910e50b5c6.avif?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=396 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/d8aa22f8926a91a618d8d9fc63022326.avif?t=1754393727\" width=162 height=12 /></span><br>Time-limited events appear based on your location, choices, and the current world state. They may trigger through exploration, quests, or as corruption spreads. Events can expire, change, or be interrupted by main story progress. Completing or ignoring them affects the world, unlocking unique rewards, merchants, or new questlines. Many are tied to the Masselite system, making each decision matter beyond the moment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/9498812810d079944a12970e771bd909.avif?t=1754393727\" width=604 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996620/extras/925a747c68bc0849fdaa032d561732bf.webp?t=1754393727\" width=616 height=17 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Godforged: Origins of Ozgalor is a story-rich, single-player Action RPG set in the world of Nelethar. Experience tactical combat, class blending, and kingdom ruling in a world besieged by a god, where your actions and choices shape the future of Ozgalor.",
